@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "InternalLoginPage / AuthContext" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "AuthController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "AuthService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "UserRepository / RefreshTokenRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "User / RefreshToken" as P4 <<entity>>
P0 -> P1: Submit login details
P1 -> P2: Check credentials
P2 -> P3: Find the account
P3 --> P2: Account found or missing
P2 -> P4: Read account credentials and status
note over P2,P4: Verify the password in AuthService via IPasswordHasher.
alt unknown user, wrong password or inactive account
P2 --> P1: Report login failure
P1 --> P0: Display login or account error
else valid credentials and active account
note over P2,P4: Create the signed access token and hashed refresh credential via TokenService.
P2 -> P4: Update login and create session
P2 -> P3: Save account and session
P3 --> P2: Confirm saved session
P2 --> P1: Return user and token pair
P1 --> P0: Open the user workspace
end
@enduml